  data: {
    LLM: "Count points, not tricks. Aces and Tens are the valuable cards. Don't waste your high trumps on low-value tricks.\n\nTrump Management: In a suit game, you have 11 trumps. Use them to capture opponents' Aces and Tens, but don't exhaust them too early.\n\nVoid Creation: If you are declarer and have a weak suit, try to void yourself in that suit early so you can trump opponents' leads.",
